# MISSED THINGS — Deep Audit of DESIGN-001 Plan & Tasks

> **Audit scope:** Full line-by-line scan of [routes.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes.ts) (6272 lines) cross-referenced against [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/Rb/.gemini/antigravity/brain/1b1a917d-86ef-4dbc-96ec-33a515cd4ef0/implementation_plan.md) and [task.md](file:///C:/Users/Rb/.gemini/antigravity/brain/1b1a917d-86ef-4dbc-96ec-33a515cd4ef0/task.md).  
> **Result:** ~40 items missed, under-documented, or incorrectly estimated.

