> [!CAUTION]
> **The 9 missing inner functions (Category 1) are the highest-risk items.** If the quote snapshot pipeline functions are not assigned a target file before execution begins, Phase 4 (Public Routes) will stall because `quotes.ts` has no spec for the ~200 lines of supporting functions it depends on. Similarly, the trade cancel route (Category 2) will be orphaned if not added to Phase 7.
